  "answer": "- **Stop:** Suspend outdoor observations when the wind interlock opens. Preserve reservation identifiers during the suspension. [ev-159aa46f19575f991571621c, `weather.md:5–8`]\n- **Restart:** Resume only after the interlock closes **and** the duty operator records restart approval. A favourable forecast cannot authorize a restart. [ev-159aa46f19575f991571621c, `weather.md:5–8`; ev-d7ad6e3c0ae0215b63ed8bb6, `weather.md:13–15`]\n- **Indoor instrument:** It may continue during a wind suspension if it is explicitly classified as indoor and its own safety interlocks remain closed. A roof shown as closed on the calendar does not establish indoor classification. [ev-0999a181d992f67ebae5ac73, `weather.md:9–12`]",
